  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Light of intensity I and wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> is incident on a single slit of width w. An interference pattern is formed on a screen located a distance d from the slits.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What change will increase the width of the central maximum?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Decrease <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\">Decrease I</li><li data-label=\"C\">Decrease d</li><li data-label=\"D\">Decrease w</li></ol>"
  },
